{"server":"tw","storyId":"act44side_level_act44side_05_end","groupId":"act44side","stageId":"act44side_05","title":"遺禍","storyCode":"AT-5","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act44side/level_act44side_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"b177f857576503451f25dea3a286bd38ee392ac8c9abb6ec08901aa8b0a157c9","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g14_mifuneoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三船先生，您真的要親自去鍛冶町嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我和鐵齋、星熊之間的事，只有我自己親自了結，這件事才算是真的圓滿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照您現在的謀劃，說實話，就算沒有般若，鐵齋也會就範。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就這麼不願意讓星熊回來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是覺得沒必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是，她一回來，你的工作量多了不少。看在你要接我班的分上，我可以講明白一點給你聽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"澪，你覺得想在御機過得好，什麼最重要？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"團結？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，最重要的是……“漂亮”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外表上的華麗美觀可以一舉扭轉世人心中的成見，你、我，我們都得益於此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果一直是當年那副小混混的打扮，恐怕我第一次上電視就會被人轟下去，更別說把金石台辦到今天這步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而做事，同樣講究漂亮，講究美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯有個我不記得名字的作家說過一句話，如果第一幕出現了一把銃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，最晚到第三幕，這把銃一定要被一個拉特蘭人握在手中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三船先生，據說哥倫比亞有一群叫黑鋼的人也會用銃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你明白我的意思就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"御機太大，發展得也太快，我們很多時候沒辦法確定自己做的事究竟是否正確……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就只能把事情做得有始有終，讓每個人都去他們該去的地方，讓每一把銃都在最後扣響，這也是漂亮，這也是美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來更像……把事情做徹底一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你願意怎麼想都隨便你。等你成了金石會的四代目會長，你可以試試看我說的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過現在，你還是專心休息，等著對付星熊吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……星熊是強敵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但她是鬼，而且是已經失控過一次的鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說過一個叫奎隆的人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"據說是個很久很久以前的人，和鬼族以及僧院有關，其他就不知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵齋以前除了那些老掉牙的武家故事，就喜歡講這個人的傳說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些傳說真假難辨，有的還自相矛盾，比如關於奎隆的死，鐵齋至少講過三種不同的版本。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但其中我最喜歡的一種就很殘忍，也很……美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在真正取得涅槃，遁入闍那之前，奎隆聽見了最後一支鬼族被迫成為葦原之民時骨肉分離的哭聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那時的奎隆已經形銷骨立，無力從無憂樹下離開，無力仗劍拯救同族，甚至無力控制自己青色的怒火——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"於是，怒火佔據了奎隆的心神，讓他徹底失去了神智，讓他以垂死之軀消滅了一整支軍隊，但他要保護的同族也全數死在他的劍下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於這個故事裡的奎隆是力盡而死，還是死於自戕，抑或是無情到即便如此仍然能心安理得地涅槃，就不得而知了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我不懂您講這位奎隆的傳說有什麼用意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當一個鬼意識到自己無能為力的那一刻，總是其最脆弱的時候。至於是一蹶不振，還是陷入瘋狂……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要對付的這一位，已經有過先例了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，快去休息吧。我也該見見我們的客人了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三船先生……您貴安？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，沒受傷吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，沒有！倒不如說這是我最近睡得最香的一覺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對嘛，做你們這一行的，就該像你這樣，風趣幽默，笑面迎人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還喜歡問東問西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打個電話給星熊，就說……我有事找她商量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個……三船先生，您看，星熊她畢竟幫了我不少……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幫你查明了“輪入道”的真相？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不只如此吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你站在攤前悵然若失的時候，到底在想什麼呢？這麼多年追逐怪談的努力都白費了，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你知道了，一切都是虛妄。你好像被我和我構築的這些怪談騙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您……為什麼要這麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這與你無關。你就當自己太倒楣吧。反正生活還是要繼續下去，所以，如果你願意，可以把一些更實在的東西抓在手裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在利誘我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"利誘？打電話，你以後繼續當你的情報商人。不打，你知道金石會對敵人做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三船先生——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想不起來，我很願意提醒你一下，記得你的右眼是怎麼不見的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……記得。當時是我為了追逐一樁怪談，衝撞了三船先生和人談事的場合……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我廢你一隻眼，是因為你當初看了不該看的東西。而我留你另一隻眼，是珍惜你的才能，也是對你的警告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，你該幫我做事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能不能請您給我幾分鐘，讓我想想——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"三船緩緩從腰間抽出刀。\n森內盯著那把刀的刀尖，看著它一寸一寸地接近自己的咽喉。\n他吞了口唾沫，連自己都不確定下一個動作究竟是張口還是閉口——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打鬥聲？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"還未等森內反應過來，辦公室的門突然被猛烈地撞開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"星、星熊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他困不住我，我還有很多事要當面問他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"森內深深看了星熊一眼，轉身快步離開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金兵衛，我從你手裡搶了人，你似乎一點也不著急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本以為要大費周章的事，突然水到渠成了，這有什麼好著急的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你寫假信讓我回來，究竟是為了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事有點複雜，我才剛跟別人說過，沒有心情再跟你講一遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過老頭子哪怕再愚鈍，也該知道其中最淺顯的一條……般若吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"般若？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們連這都想不到？哈哈，不愧是能把親生兒子都逼到和他反目成仇的“任俠”，不愧是他偏愛的“金石會的青鬼”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"澪！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休息時間好像不太夠，不過，還是幫我拖住她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拖住我，你的人就能贏鐵齋叔？做夢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼非要在刀劍上拼個輸贏？這有意義嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你還能怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三船","speakerId":"avg_npc_1896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失陪了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站住——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該站住的是你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"火光。嗡鳴。\n一排排屏風依然錯落地佇立在目及之處，紋絲不動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們已經護送三船先生走了。你現在的對手是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的刀。出鞘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……對付你還用不著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"澪的身後傳來刺耳的金屬摩擦聲，一隻黑色的“鬼手”從她的身後鑽出，不急不慢地繞在白色的短刀上。\n一個人，三隻手，三把刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的確很強，但這不代表此時此刻你能從我這裡脫身，更別說你連刀都不願意出鞘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰說我的武器只有這把刀？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"話音還未落，星熊高抬右腿，腳重重地砸向了旁邊的圓桌。\n圓桌翻轉著飛上了空中，遮住對手的視線。\n一個有力的躍步，星熊連刀帶鞘瞄準對手的頭——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"而迎接她的是三道刀光，以及被刀光平平整整地切開的圓桌。\n刀鞘跟那隻黑色的手相碰，一股驚人的力量從鞘上傳來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喝啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g14_mifuneoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好強的蠻力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底為什麼不出鞘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與你無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你在害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？害怕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怕刀出鞘，會發生你不願意發生的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奎隆的死……原來如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奎隆的死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……但無論你此刻是否出鞘，你害怕的事都會發生。如果三船先生預料得沒錯，你都會走向那個結局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽不懂你在說什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……卑鄙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。不是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在說我自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"奔跑。逃跑。\n森內不知道自己跑了多久，他只感覺到五臟六腑都在抖動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g5_kajistreet_d"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g5_kajistreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……呼……呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我甩掉他們了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你自己出來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的神明","speakerId":"avg_npc_1904_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼快就忘記我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"神明大人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的神明","speakerId":"avg_npc_1904_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這樣看我。我不是來幫你的。我討厭在你的攤子那裡得到的怪談的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的神明","speakerId":"avg_npc_1904_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非常討厭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的神明","speakerId":"avg_npc_1904_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來想著從此和你與怪談都徹底斷絕關係，甚至離開御機，去北邊散散心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的神明","speakerId":"avg_npc_1904_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，就在這個時候，有個傢伙拜託了我一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？宮司大人嗎？他請您來找我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的神明","speakerId":"avg_npc_1904_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那還會有誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的神明","speakerId":"avg_npc_1904_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的神明","speakerId":"avg_npc_1904_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個傢伙只讓我轉告一句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的神明","speakerId":"avg_npc_1904_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“吾輩會在你常去的那個天台見你。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“吾輩”？他——祂？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的神明","speakerId":"avg_npc_1904_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話已經轉告了。我該走了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"神明將獨輪車頭轉向，剛想騎起來，森內已經跑遠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的神明","speakerId":"avg_npc_1904_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的神明","speakerId":"avg_npc_1904_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……找你找了這麼多年，結果你就這樣報答人家的，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好事的神明","speakerId":"avg_npc_1904_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我又管得了誰呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"噠。噠。噠。\n森內拾級而上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"門開啟的一瞬間，一陣風朝森內迎面吹來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"多少個夕陽時分，他就躺在天台之上，看著天空由紅變暗，直到星星依稀可見，又被城市亮起的燈光掩蓋。\n現在時候尚早，天台上本不該是這般黃昏似的景色，但他無暇顧及這些，或者，他將這也當成了神明將至的某種預兆。\n他盯著天空，甚至不知道自己現在的心情如何。\n興奮？激動？如願以償？空虛？落寞？\n但無論如何，他終究還是一個人躺在那裡，等著一個也許永遠都不會來的客人……\n直到悶熱的風讓他不知不覺陷入沉眠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g7_jinja_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的森內","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"父親……神龕的後面好像有什麼東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1908_1","isRemote":false,"text":"徹，在神社這種嚴肅的場所，不要隨便亂看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的森內","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是那邊真的有……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1911_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿徹，快點過來，輪到我們祈福了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1911_1","isRemote":false,"text":"神明大人，希望我們一家人能平平安安，趕快還完欠的貸款……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的森內","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1903_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g15_higashiroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1908_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣……貸款應該就還完了，而且還有盈餘……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1908_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們家終於脫離困境了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g13_rooftop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的森內","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咦？您……怎麼來這裡了？神社裡面很悶嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的森內","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"神明大人，謝謝您！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的森內","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最近父親變得很開心，母親也有時間帶我出去玩了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1903_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的森內","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我還能再來找您嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1903_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的森內","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——不，我一定會再來找您的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的森內","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"神明大人，我家的店開了！好漂亮的店，您要來看看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年幼的森內","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"神明大人，我向您道歉，這段時間我一直在幫家裡的忙，所以沒來找您……請您不要生氣，別再躲我了，好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年少的森內","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"神明大人，您……在嗎？您已經離我而去了？還是說……您不願意見我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年少的森內","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我就當您只是不願意見我，但還在聽我說話，好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的森內","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最近家裡出了一些變故，父親他可能又得回去做苦工了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的森內","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"母親一直幫人縫補衣服，眼睛越來越差了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的森內","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我知道，這一定跟您沒有關係，您已經庇佑我們家這麼多了，一定不可能再收回去的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的森內","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……對嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再年輕的森內","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"神明大人，父親他……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再年輕的森內","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他死了。接受不了那麼大的打擊，把自己喝死了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g13_rooftop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……所以，請問您在哪裡呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森內","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"神明大人，請問您到底……在哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_oldwarehouse_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這間兇宅……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是空的……有問題！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherunder_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這棟房屋竟然能夠通往移動城市的地下結構？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這要怎麼找？這就不只是一棟房子或者一個鍛冶町那麼大了，整個地塊說不定都是相通的……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別灰心！只要找到那個混蛋——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這、這是？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"哲也瞠目結舌，站在了原地。他面前密密麻麻地堆了幾十個箱子，顯然是有人刻意堆放在這裡的。\n他用力眨了眨眼睛，走上前去，緩緩打開其中一個箱子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……武器？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"制式刀、弩……擲彈筒……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上面印著的是……帆足家的家徽？北院的大家族？這裡是他們藏軍火的地方？！"},{"type":"narration","text":"他把裝滿武器的箱子搬下來，打開原本壓在下面的箱子，發現裡面是北院制式的軍用食品和醫療器材。\n他發瘋似地把箱子一個個搬下來，再逐一打開。\n所有打開的箱子，無一例外，全都裝著北院生產的軍事用品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……當年爸拼死否認的北院軍火？！怎麼會在這裡——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隱匿的忍者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1917_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小子，你做過頭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隱匿的忍者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1917_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆要你找北院間諜的線索，你找到就夠了。這樣一箱一箱地翻開，事後還得收拾，很麻煩啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你剛剛拍了我的照片？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隱匿的忍者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1917_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟是大功一件，拍個照，免得日後出現問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隱匿的忍者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1917_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隱匿的忍者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1917_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去見三船先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等、等一下。你在跟蹤我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隱匿的忍者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1917_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不重要，重要的是，你在為三船先生做事，我也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隱匿的忍者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1917_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有你的面具，一起拿下來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哲也","speakerId":"avg_npc_1899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隱匿的忍者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1917_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆等一下要正式接見你，你還戴著一個面具，多少還是有點不尊重吧？"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知為何，哲也忽然覺得有一陣寒風從通道深處吹來，吹得他脊背發涼，但他此刻別無選擇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
